[38;2;124;124;124mPSL(2,5) is simple and why A_5 is the unique simple group of order 60, or just [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mcite these as standard results.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mActually, the uniqueness of the simple group of order 60 is a standard result [0m
